---
// Official PoPETs landing page (abstract, PDF, BibTeX, DOI 10.2478/popets-2021-0055).
const PAPER_URL = 'https://petsymposium.org/popets/2021/popets-2021-0055.php';
---
<section id="publication" class="relative z-10 bg-ink border-t border-ink-line">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1400px] px-5 md:px-10 py-24 md:py-36">
    <p class="kicker mb-4" data-reveal>Publication</p>

    <div class="max-w-4xl" data-reveal>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-8">
        <span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-emerald">PoPETs 2021</span>
        <span class="h-px flex-1 bg-ink-line"></span>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs text-cream-dim">Peer-reviewed</span>
      </div>

      <a
        href={PAPER_URL}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="group block mb-8"
      >
        <h3 class="display text-cream text-3xl md:text-5xl leading-[1.05] group-hover:text-emerald transition-colors">
          A First Look at Private Communications in Video Games using Visual Features
        </h3>
        <span class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-emerald">
          Read the paper
          <span class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1">&#8599;</span>
        </span>
      </a>

      <p class="text-cream-dim leading-relaxed mb-6 max-w-2xl">
        A. Wajid, N. Kamal, M. Sharjeel, R. M. Sheikh, <span class="text-cream">H. B. Wasim</span>,
        M. H. Ali, W. Hussain, S. T. Ali, L. Anjum.
        <span class="text-cream-dim/70">Proceedings on Privacy Enhancing Technologies, 2021(3), pp. 433–452.</span>
      </p>

      <p class="text-cream-dim/80 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
        An end-to-end ML study of covert communication channels inside video games — from data
        labeling and feature engineering through model training and evaluation.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
